BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.75 Tm (cut per shipment can be worth thousands a year. Ask for the express minimum reductions table by name on FedEx) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.52 Tm (paper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.30 Tm (Signed paper carries clawbacks that wipe out negotiated gains. Good Citizens Society earns a 6.5% year-end rebate but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.07 Tm (reports it can be pulled for late payment or missed revenue tiers; FedEx pulled theirs, worth hundreds of thousands, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.85 Tm (they left FedEx, and UPS did the same in 2019 and still owes them more than $100,000 even though, in their words, we) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.62 Tm (lost the lawsuit [72KTU2Th6eY @ 00:01:03]. Refund Retriever's warning is structural: incentives are tied to volume,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.40 Tm (and a drop can push a shipper back to published rates [j2T9_igpwQU @ 00:00:27]. Shipware's veterans catalogue the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.17 Tm (fine print in FedEx agreements that run 30-plus pages: early termination fees typically reach six figures, net-spend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.95 Tm (targets are opaque, term-two surcharge cuts shrink, and a CPI-above-3% clause turns a 3% rate cap into 6.9%) Tj ET
