BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Burke lays out the most complete workflow in six phases: data collection of three to five years of bills plus special) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (contracts, tariff sheets, meter information, and tax exemption certificates; a baseline review mapping which meters feed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (which facilities and flagging accounts on odd rates or with demand charges out of proportion to consumption; a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (bill-by-bill examination; error quantification across the whole audit period; a recovery report; and forward-looking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (recommendations [4pb6YRGZx4s @ 00:03:08]. The intake load on the client is deliberately light. Puleo Energy asks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (only for recent invoices plus authorization to download historical invoices directly from the utilities, quoting six to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (eight weeks for the full audit with preliminary findings along the way, then preparing all the paperwork for the utility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (once the client approves the findings [a4dO2n1QfzQ @ 00:05:06]. Waste Consultants starts with just the most current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (invoice per account, then pulls 12 months of history from the vendor's online billing portal, noting most companies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (hand over an invoice or login in a few hours, with audits running 30 to 90 days depending on location count) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm ([zV8cq0gJWOA @ 00:01:50]. Ashokan Water Meter and Backflow strips water intake even further, asking only for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (property address and bringing accountants, lawyers, forensic auditors, programmers, and engineering staff to find) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (physical as well as accounting errors [PRQE0XuoBbg @ 00:01:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The line-item checks are specific. Burke's bill-by-bill test asks whether the correct tariff applies for customer type and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (voltage level, whether energy and demand charges including time-of-use windows compute correctly, whether meter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (readings and multipliers match the meter nameplate or reveal estimated reads never trued up, whether contract terms) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (and tax exemptions held, and whether ratchets and riders follow commission-approved rules [4pb6YRGZx4s @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (00:03:51]. Vert Energy Group's XYZ case shows the payoff: a misclassification onto the small business rate plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (produced $21,000 in overpayments over a year and a half, and a misread demand charge five times the normal read) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (added $3,500, yielding a negotiated refund of $24,500 [bQpXnGBfNJY @ 00:02:36]. UB Engineering's version) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (reviews 30 months of billing, finds the same $21,000 small-business-rate overcharge plus a $5,400 meter-reader) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (typographical error, and puts the refund at almost $30,000 [V-4ioYMhiuo @ 00:01:56]. Ratchets deserve hand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (calculation: Oncor sets its demand ratchet at 80 percent of the trailing 12-month peak, so a 135 kW August peak locks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (in 108 kW for the next 11 months, meaning a 100 kW October bills at 108 kW while a 132 kW September bills at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (actual demand, until a new peak above 135 kW resets the ratchet higher [yHlhF0nEJ14 @ 00:02:08].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (Pricing is where the dollars get split. Puleo Energy, through National Utilities Refund, bills 50 percent of any refund) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (check or bill credit only after it lands, and 50 percent of realized monthly savings from corrected recurring errors or) Tj ET
