BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.87 Tm (positive other expense labeled 481A adjustment [hjpQzDqWetI @ 00:25:32]. Two copies go out, and only the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 305.65 Tm (separately mailed copy needs a signature, from both spouses on a joint return. Short-term rentals averaging under 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.42 Tm (days must run the structure over 39 years, not 27.5, and Tax Modern folds that correction into the same filing. Keith) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.20 Tm (Schrader adds that software will not compute the 15-year catch-up correctly, so the operator calculates by hand and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.97 Tm (overrides the default. His math is $6,893 of 15-year basis times the 48.81% seven-year cumulative rate, which gives) Tj ET
