BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.52 Tm ($1,502 for that allocated figure, and he had already absorbed a two-dollar rounding error to reconcile the schedule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.30 Tm ([XhVfWjlDk3w @ 00:10:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.07 Tm (Asset Wise Institute's warning is that a big study number can be dead on arrival. Their example is a high-income) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.85 Tm (professional who exchanges into a $2 million multifamily building and buys a study. That investor may find the losses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 168.62 Tm (passive and partly suspended, carried forward instead of wiping out salary income [e9edFqL1urU @ 00:05:17]. Timing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.40 Tm (burns operators too. Close on December 20, renovate through January and February, and the building is not ready and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.17 Tm (available until March, so the expected year-of-closing depreciation never lands [e9edFqL1urU @ 00:07:30]. Asset) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.95 Tm (Wise's fix is treating the first 90 days after closing as a tax setup period. GavTax Advisory Services lists three pitfalls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 107.72 Tm (The first is misclassifying additions or structural work as short-life assets. The second is thin documentation without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 92.50 Tm (engineering reports, invoices, service dates, and categorized asset lists. The third is forgetting that the IRS may reclaim) Tj ET
