BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.97 Tm (Turn the $2,400 into a recruiting weapon by splitting it with the new hire as a $1,200 signing bonus or a $1,200 stay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 251.75 Tm (bonus after 90 days to land higher-quality people [TGG Accounting - DBpv31eMcBA @ 00:01:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 236.52 Tm (Build a pre-screened applicant pool by asking screener questions in exact Form 8850 language before choosing who to) Tj ET
