BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (The sharpest conflict is when to ask the eligibility questions. Lydia at Workstream tells employers they are allowed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (run screener questions before choosing who to interview, then push likely qualifiers to the next stage; she says it sounds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (discriminatory but is not, because the program was written to tip the choice between two identical applicants) Tj ET
