BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (the hiring decision [tAf8rI1hwtc @ 00:27:58]. Fenton Tax Help sits in between, instructing employers to pre-screen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (with Form 8850 on or before the date of the job offer [3iHBB7snmho @ 00:08:15]. Pick a lane deliberately:) Tj ET
