BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (Practitioners do not even agree on the clock. Gift CPAs states flatly that Form 8850 and Form 9061 must reach the state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (workforce agency within 28 days of the employee's start date, and that if they do not, there is no point filing because no) Tj ET
