BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (benchmark year 3, and ACOs below 5,000 in benchmark years 1 or 2 are pushed into the Basic track with caps and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (exclusions [rPy0GAiwUUc @ 00:05:25]. Risk-score capture is the quiet multiplier. Davis notes 1.0 is average and 0.90) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (means 10% less expected spending, so an under-coded panel carries a lower expected-spending figure, and) Tj ET
